.TH "mptopdf" "1" "01-01-2026" "version 1.4.1" "convert MetaPost figures to PDF"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
 mptopdf \- convert MetaPost figures to PDF
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B mptopdf [
.I OPTIONS ...
.B ] [
.I FILENAMES
.B ]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.B convert MetaPost figures to PDF
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.B --metafun
use the metafun format to process the file (default is mpost)
.TP
.B --texexec
use texexec (context) to process text snippets
.TP
.B --latex
use latex to process text snippets
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
